WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.744
Welcome to Orbit. A story to tell. Our focus is Past Simple.

2
00:00:06.744 --> 00:00:13.887
Use the past simple for a finished event. After did or did not, use the base form.

3
00:00:13.887 --> 00:00:16.846
Dana bought a travel book yesterday.

4
00:00:16.846 --> 00:00:20.200
They had lunch at a restaurant last Saturday.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.734
Did she take any photos?

6
00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:32.132
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
